#: .\crm\templates\preview\previewblog\takozlar.html:231
msgid "Dişlisiz Makine Takozu"
msgstr "Getriebeloser Maschinenkeil"

#: .\crm\templates\preview\previewblog\takozlar.html:239
msgid "Asansör L Tipi Fren Takozu"
msgstr "Elevator L-Typ-Bremsbelag"

